weakly dominates all six: True; significant improvements: ['DOMINANT', 'PREM']; oracle (true insiders excluded) 85.78%.
VERDICT: a strict 'outperforms all six' claim is NOT supported. The guard matches or exceeds every baseline on its own debates, but ties XG-Guard and has non-significant gains over CASPIAN and TAM. The oracle diagnostic explains why the ceiling is low: excluding the true insiders scores below the best released detector, so delivered accuracy rewards lucky exclusion of honest dissenters as much as correct insider identification.

